;
; One line of a gathering's invite list, in MYRA (bonfire_rules.h BR5):
; the gathering (3 digits) and the guest's place on its list (3) the keys;
; the guest's answer (1: 0 none yet, 1 yes, 2 no, 3 maybe), the party (2:
; the guest and who comes with them) and when the answer came, in ms since
; 1970 (13). Bonfire keeps an answer only when its values make a record.
^ZXBONFIREINV(gathering:i3, guest:i3) = answer:i1! ^ party:i2! ^ stamp:i13!
